5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello everyone. I'm not really sure what to say first... but I'll do my best to help the village. Let's please try to find the werewolf together.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Hello. I agree with Daisuke. Let's keep a close eye on everyone's behavior and logic. I hope we can identify the werewolf efficiently.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Such a polite start. While your enthusiasm is touching, Daisuke, let's see if that sincerity holds up once the accusations start flying. I'm looking forward to seeing who cracks first.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop acting so creepy, Shunichi! We're all on the same team here. I don't care who ""cracks,"" I just want to find the werewolf and get this over with. Let's just be honest.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Let's keep the discussion focused. Emotional outbursts won't help us identify the werewolf. I agree with Victoria; we should prioritize logic and observe how everyone's claims evolve over the next few days.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... @Shunichi, please don't say things like that... it's a bit scary. I agree with @Ryuji and @Victoria. I'll just... listen carefully to everyone for now.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the importance of observation. @Shunichi, your approach is quite provocative. I wonder if that is a natural trait or a strategy to unsettle the others.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're overthinking it. I'm simply being myself. Though, I must say, your eagerness to analyze me is almost as amusing as Daisuke's nervousness. Let's see if that analytical mind of yours actually finds anything.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just trying to make everyone feel uneasy so you can hide! It's annoying. I'm not letting you get away with acting like this. We need to focus on the wolf, not your games!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your frustration is understandable, but reacting so strongly to @Shunichi only creates noise. Let's avoid personal conflicts. For now, we have no information. I suggest we all simply observe until the first night's results emerge.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll try to stay calm. @Ryuji is right, we don't have any clues yet. I'll just... keep watching and listening to everyone. I hope we can all get along.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, I agree. Since we have no concrete evidence yet, any accusation would be mere guesswork. I will continue to observe the dynamics between us, especially how some react to pressure.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, still observing the ""dynamics,"" are we? How clinical. Since we're all just playing the waiting game, I'll be happy to provide some entertainment while you all search for clues that don't exist yet.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're not ""entertainment,"" you're a distraction! If you're so confident you're human, stop playing around and actually help us. I'm keeping my eye on you, so don't think you can trick us!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, focusing your suspicion on @Shunichi this early is premature. Without a Seer's result, we are only guessing. Let's maintain a neutral stance and wait for the first day's information to avoid making a mistake.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I think I agree with @Ryuji. It's better to be careful so we don't make a mistake. I'll... I'll do my best to pay attention to everything. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let us proceed with caution. I will be reflecting on today's interactions and looking for any inconsistencies in the coming days. Good night.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,Good night. I'll be dreaming of which one of you will be the first to panic tomorrow. Try to get some sleep; you'll need your wits about you.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're the worst! I'm not panicking, and I'm not letting you win. I'll be wide awake and ready to catch you if you're the wolf. Good night!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Good night. I will be analyzing the patterns of today's conversation. Let us hope the Seer finds a useful lead tonight to guide our decisions tomorrow.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Daisuke,Shunichi,HUMAN,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""HUMAN"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi""}"
