31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I... I have some information. I'm the Seer, and I checked @Shunichi last night. He is... he's human. I'm sorry if this is sudden, but I thought it was better to tell you now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, thank you for coming forward so quickly. If your claim is true, that significantly narrows our search. @Shunichi, how do you react to being cleared by the Seer? Does this change your approach to the discussion?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, how convenient. I appreciate the vote of confidence, though I'm sure I would have survived regardless. @Victoria, it doesn't change a thing. I'm still the most composed person in this room.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, are you sure? I really didn't want to believe @Shunichi is a good guy! But if you're the Seer, I'll trust you for now. @Shunichi, don't think this means I've stopped watching you!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, claiming the Seer role so early is a bold move. While it provides a clear direction, we must consider if this is a genuine reveal or a strategic play by the werewolf or possessed to gain trust.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji... I understand why you're worried. I'm... I'm really nervous, but I just wanted to help. I don't want us to execute someone innocent because of a misunderstanding. Please... please believe me.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, your caution is logical, but @Daisuke's nervousness seems genuine. If he were the werewolf, would he risk such an early reveal? I'm curious if anyone else feels @Daisuke's behavior is inconsistent with a fake claim.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're practically swooning over his ""genuine"" nervousness. How quaint. @Ryuji is the only one here actually thinking. Whether @Daisuke is a clumsy Seer or a desperate liar, the result is the same: we're all just guessing.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, shut up! @Daisuke is trying his best to help us, and you're just making fun of him! @Ryuji, I get being careful, but if we don't trust our own Seer, we're just letting the wolf win!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, trust is not a tool for victory; evidence is. If @Daisuke is the Seer, we have a lead. If he is not, we are being misled. I am not dismissing him, but we must remain objective.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll try to be more objective too. I know I'm not very confident, but I really did see that @Shunichi is human. I just... I really want us to find the wolf together. Please, let's trust each other.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, while objectivity is key, we must also weigh the risk of ignoring a genuine Seer. If we disregard @Daisuke and he is telling the truth, we waste a vital asset. Does anyone have a reason to doubt him beyond general caution?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're so desperate to find a ""vital asset"" that you're ignoring the obvious. @Daisuke's desperation is a perfect mask. Of course, I'm ""human"" according to him—it's the easiest way to buy my silence and trust. How thoughtful of him.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just trying to sow doubt because you're scared! @Daisuke is being honest, and you're just twisting everything to make us fight. I'm sick of your games! I believe @Daisuke, and I'm voting for you if you keep this up!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, voting based on irritation is exactly how the village makes mistakes. @Shunichi, your skepticism is noted, but @Daisuke's claim is the only concrete lead we have. We must decide if the risk of a fake Seer outweighs the risk of ignoring a real one.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm sorry for making things so confusing. I just want to do the right thing. If you can't trust me yet, I understand... but please, let's think carefully about who we vote for today.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, the risk of ignoring a real Seer is higher than the risk of a fake one, as we have no other leads. @Daisuke's consistency suggests honesty. I believe we should trust his result and look elsewhere.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, your faith is almost touching. If you're so convinced, then by all means, follow the ""nervous"" boy. I'll just sit back and watch as you all potentially walk right into a trap. How thrilling.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just a coward who likes to watch others suffer! I'm done with you. I trust @Daisuke, and since @Shunichi is just trying to mess with our heads, he's the most suspicious one here! I'm voting for him!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your emotional reaction is clouding your judgment. @Daisuke has cleared @Shunichi. If we execute a human based on personality clashes, we lose a valuable member. I suggest we vote to skip or look for other inconsistencies.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
